    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5aa83a7041a90085d3e6fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园。那是一所培养――\n在闪耀系列赛中活跃的赛马娘的、\n初高中连读的教育机构。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca0179f56f2a33eab86bf3636e1798b88d990400b7d9a00502097ba324555e4",
