      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这所学园汇集了来自全国各地\n才华出众的赛马娘。然而……\n也有许多孩子直至退役都未能斩获一胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05a476c6bb3ec1cbf3bccaf0823a72f228e7741667cbdc6369bd2b91403df4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
